pen its Terminal Island depot at the Port of Long Beach in the first quarter, and Nevoya expects to start a Houston–Dallas operation with 63 Class 8 electric trucks in early 2027. The article also cites a NACFE long-haul model that found diesel remained the lowest-cost option through 2028.</description></item><item><title>Diesel-tax evasion scheme lands California man in prison</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-tax-evasion-scheme-lands-california-man-in-prison-817fe092c4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-tax-evasion-scheme-lands-california-man-in-prison-817fe092c4/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:56:25 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>eTrucker</description></item><item><title>Who is hauling all the cheap freight? ELD fraud, trucking impacts</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/who-is-hauling-all-the-cheap-freight-eld-fraud-trucking-impacts-033ad2067e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/who-is-hauling-all-the-cheap-freight-eld-fraud-trucking-impacts-033ad2067e/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:21:27 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>Overdrive Magazine</description></item><item><title>Diesel price drop good news for Maritime truckers</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-price-drop-good-news-for-maritime-truckers-d5d24517d6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-price-drop-good-news-for-maritime-truckers-d5d24517d6/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:10:12 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>CTV News</description></item><item><title>US Visa Revocations Pressure Mexico’s Cross-Border Trucking</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/us-visa-revocations-pressure-mexico-s-cross-border-trucking-0b3d668851/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/us-visa-revocations-pressure-mexico-s-cross-border-trucking-0b3d668851/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:06:07 +0000</pubDate>